      en: ["The Société Africaine de Raffinage in Mbao is the country's only oil refinery.", "Located in the West African state of Senegal.", "The region is marked by a tropical-dry climate.", "Accessible via the national road network.", "Plays a role in the local economy and culture.", "Representative of the diversity of the Senegalese landscape."]
